/target/
# criterion falls back to <package root>/target/criterion when it can't resolve
# the workspace target dir. Anchored so a source dir named target isn't hidden.
/crates/*/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
.DS_Store
*.swp
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
/*.png
.venv
node_modules/
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/
.claude/worktrees/
drift-report.md
__pycache__/
codecov.json
mutants.out/
mutants.out.old/

# Recorder output awaiting a diff — promote it or delete it, never commit it.
*.jsonl.new
provenance.json.new

# Any of these switches Claude Code to CLAUDE.md-only, hiding every AGENTS.md
# (CLAUDE.md also matches .claude/CLAUDE.md).
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
